# Bassalt demo reel: 10 s at 60 fps.
#     bstest --film 600 --size 960x540 --script docs/demo.cues | ffmpeg ...
# The warm lamp at 30x for two seconds; then Pour, and the card's bright ring
# and bar become wax at the water's temperature -- above T*, so they rise,
# neck and break up. Behind for the first half, Dyed for the second.
#
# Tracks are held before their first key and interpolated BETWEEN keys, so a
# button is three keys: 119 Pour 0 / 120 Pour 1 / 121 Pour 0.
0    Speed       0.6
0    Pour        0
119  Pour        0
120  Pour        1
121  Pour        0
0    Clip        0
299  Clip        0
300  Clip        1
